{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手王灝兒（JW）日前在社交網公開1年前秘婚婚照後，兩夫妻愈愛愈高調，她的有米足球隊班主老公王至尊日前接受網上節目訪問時，隔空向太太發表愛的宣言，更為愛妻被指「拜金」之說而平反，十足廿四孝老公。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:22:38.705832+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:15:57.074908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:15:57.074908+00:00","content_hash":"2a8749255e022006d4a557acf58f87c359d8c6f07ce5a46c701b7ba288429d2f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}